--------------------------------------------------------------------
WHAT WOULD MAKE THIS PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Resolve the role comparison by identity rather than by Hash at
loader.go:1075 -- e.g. compare against both forms the way idxByIdentity
already does six lines above, or reuse identityKey(pair.Left). Then add the
consumer-level assertion ruling 2026-08-16f demands: a test that resolves a
duplicate through the public SaveDuplicateDecision path and asserts
ResolvedDuplicates()[0].Left is the row the user KEPT, for the case where
the suppressed side is Left. The current suite has no such case -- every
existing fixture suppresses the Right row, which is why the whole suite
stays green over this defect.
